{"timestamp":1774894492631,"source_app":"agentic-harness","session_id":"63cd17a6-4459-4637-84d9-a5d720a01456","hook_event_type":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_use_id":"toolu_01MzNpxz5XuBn3nA7kZEStWT","payload":{"session_id":"63cd17a6-4459-4637-84d9-a5d720a01456","transcript_path":"/Users/rivero/.claude/projects/-Users-rivero-ai-agentic-experience-apps-mas-trees-3d2193cb/63cd17a6-4459-4637-84d9-a5d720a01456.jsonl","cwd":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-experience/apps/mas/trees/3d2193cb","permission_mode":"bypassPermissions","hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-experience/apps/mas/trees/3d2193cb/.pinata/specs/issue-11-adw-3d2193cb-sdlc_planner-prevent-duplicate-fragment-title.md","content":"# Plan: Prevent duplicate Fragment Title for cloned cards in M@S Studio\n\n## Summary\nWhen a user clones a card, the clone dialog pre-fills the title field with the original card's title, making it easy to accidentally create two cards with the same Fragment Title. This plan adds a `generateUniqueTitle` utility that auto-increments a `-N` suffix and wires it into both clone dialog components so the pre-filled title is always unique within the current tag path on first open.\n\n## Task Description\nAdd uniqueness deduplication to the Fragment Title field when the clone dialog opens. Before the dialog is shown, compute a unique title by checking existing fragment titles in the current path's store and appending `-1`, `-2`, etc. until a non-colliding title is found. The user may still edit the title freely \u2014 only the initial pre-filled value is deduplicated. Manual edits are never blocked.\n\n## Relevant Files\n\n| File | Action | Why |\n|------|--------|-----|\n| `studio/src/utils.js` | Edit \u2014 add `generateUniqueTitle` | Shared utility for computing a unique title with numeric suffix |\n| `studio/src/mas-fragment-editor.js` | Edit \u2014 `showClone()`, `cancelClone()`, `cloneConfirmationDialog` | Primary clone flow; needs to pre-populate `titleClone` with unique title |\n| `studio/src/editor-panel.js` | Edit \u2014 `showClone()`, `cancelClone()`, `cloneConfirmationDialog` | Secondary clone flow (editor panel view); same logic |\n| `studio/test/utils.test.js` | Edit \u2014 add unit tests | Verify `generateUniqueTitle` handles all suffix cases |\n\n## Step by Step Tasks\n\n### 1. Add `generateUniqueTitle` to `studio/src/utils.js`\n- Export a new function `generateUniqueTitle(baseTitle, existingTitles)`:\n  - Convert `existingTitles` to a `Set` for O(1) lookups.\n  - If `baseTitle` is not in the set, return it unchanged.\n  - Strip any trailing `-\\d+` suffix from `baseTitle` to get the stem (e.g. `lucy-card-1` \u2192 stem `lucy-card`, startCounter `2`; `lucy-card` \u2192 stem `lucy-card`, startCounter `1`).\n  - Iterate `${stem}-${counter}` until a candidate is not found in the set; return it.\n\n```js\nexport function generateUniqueTitle(baseTitle, existingTitles) {\n    const titleSet = new Set(existingTitles);\n    if (!titleSet.has(baseTitle)) return baseTitle;\n    const match = baseTitle.match(/^(.*)-(\\d+)$/);\n    const stem = match ? match[1] : baseTitle;\n    let counter = match ? parseInt(match[2], 10) + 1 : 1;\n    let candidate = `${stem}-${counter}`;\n    while (titleSet.has(candidate)) {\n        counter++;\n        candidate = `${stem}-${counter}`;\n    }\n    return candidate;\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Update `showClone()` in `studio/src/mas-fragment-editor.js`\n- After confirming discard and before `this.showCloneDialog = true`, collect existing titles from `Store.fragments.list.data.get()` and compute the unique title:\n  ```js\n  const fragments = Store.fragments.list.data.get() ?? [];\n  const existingTitles = fragments.map((fs) => fs.get?.()?.title).filter(Boolean);\n  this.titleClone = generateUniqueTitle(this.fragment.title, existingTitles);\n  ```\n- Import `generateUniqueTitle` from `'./utils.js'`.\n\n### 3. Update `cancelClone()` in `studio/src/mas-fragment-editor.js`\n- Reset `this.titleClone = ''` when the clone dialog is dismissed so stale state does not persist.\n\n### 4. Update `cloneConfirmationDialog` getter in `studio/src/mas-fragment-editor.js`\n- Change the `sp-textfield` value binding from `value=\"${this.fragment.title}\"` to `value=\"${this.titleClone}\"` so it reflects the pre-computed unique title (or whatever the user has typed).\n\n### 5. Apply the same three changes to `studio/src/editor-panel.js`\n- Same `showClone()` update: compute `this.titleClone` using `generateUniqueTitle` before showing the dialog.\n- Same `cancelClone()` update: reset `this.titleClone = ''`.\n- Same `cloneConfirmationDialog` update: change `sp-textfield value` binding to `this.titleClone`.\n- Import `generateUniqueTitle` from `'./utils.js'`.\n\n### 6. Add unit tests in `studio/test/utils.test.js`\n- Import `generateUniqueTitle` from `'../src/utils.js'`.\n- Test cases:\n  - Title not in existing set \u2192 returns title unchanged.\n  - Title in set, no numeric suffix \u2192 returns `title-1`.\n  - Title in set, suffix `-1` exists \u2192 strips to stem, returns `stem-2`.\n  - Multiple clones already exist (`stem-1`, `stem-2`) \u2192 returns `stem-3`.\n  - Empty existing titles array \u2192 returns title unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Cloning a card whose title already exists in the current path pre-fills the clone dialog with `<title>-1`.\n- If `<title>-1` also exists, pre-fills with `<title>-2`, and so on.\n- Cloning a card named `lucy-card-1` pre-fills with `lucy-card-2` (strips existing suffix).\n- The original card's title is never modified.\n- The user can still type any title in the clone dialog; no validation blocks manual input.\n- No two cards share the same Fragment Title + Path after a clone operation using the default pre-filled title.\n\n## Validation Commands\n- `node --check studio/src/utils.js`\n- `node --check studio/src/mas-fragment-editor.js`\n- `node --check studio/src/editor-panel.js`\n"},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MzNpxz5XuBn3nA7kZEStWT"}}
